    "After an account is deleted, data will be retained for 90 days (for anti-fraud and recovery purposes) before being permanently deleted, including usage logs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After an account is deleted, data will be retained for 90 days (for anti-fraud and recovery purposes) before being permanently deleted, including usage logs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号删除后，数据将保留 90 天（用于反欺诈和恢复目的），然后永久删除，包括使用日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After authenticating, remote LLM conversations are proxied through api.polang.net to the LLM provider for the current request only. The server only records call counts and token usage, not conversation content.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After authenticating, remote LLM conversations are proxied through api.polang.net to the LLM provider for the current request only. The server only records call counts and token usage, not conversation content."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "认证后，远程 LLM 对话经 api.polang.net 代理转发至 LLM 供应商，仅处理当前请求。服务器只记录调用次数和 Token 用量，不记录对话内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
